# Allow-list: images only ever need the Go code and the migration helper.
# Everything else (Flutter apps, node_modules, .git, docs) stays out, which keeps
# builds fast and keeps local secrets out of images.
*
!shared/go
!services
!deploy/platform/bin/migrate.sh

# Never bake local settings files (real passwords) into an image.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.env
**/node_modules
**/coverage*.out
